WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.047 --> 00:00:03.795
YING NAN
Those who came before us

00:00:04.915 --> 00:00:06.590
made us who we are today.

00:00:08.352 --> 00:00:10.844
Everything you need
is already inside of you.

00:00:12.516 --> 00:00:13.880
WONG
There's no going back.

00:00:15.443 --> 00:00:16.506
SHANG CHI
It's time to show the world

00:00:16.506 --> 00:00:17.572
who I really am.

00:00:19.209 --> 00:00:20.276
KATY
Hell yeah.

00:00:23.594 --> 00:00:25.328
SOO
Two weeks ago you were parking cars,

00:00:25.379 --> 00:00:26.921
and you're now saving the world?

00:00:26.972 --> 00:00:27.778
SHANG CHI
Yeah.

